                        "name": "search_agent",
                        "response": {
                          "result": "Pizza prices for Cheese, Pepperoni, and Veggie pizzas can vary significantly between Pizza Hut, Little Caesars, and Domino's, often depending on location, size, crust type, and current promotions. Here's a comparison of general price ranges based on available information:\n\n### Pizza Hut\n\nPizza Hut offers a range of sizes and specialty pizzas, with prices varying by location.\n*   **Cheese Pizza:** A large cheese pizza can start around $16.49, though local prices may show it around $21.61 in Redwood City or $18.83 in Virginia Beach. A Personal Pan Pizza with one topping generally starts at $7.99.\n*   **Pepperoni Pizza:** A pepperoni pizza can start at approximately $18.99. Specialty options like the \"Pepperoni Lover's\u00ae Pizza\" were listed at $28.55 in Redwood City. \"Double Pepperoni Pizza\" starts at $21.99.\n*   **Veggie Pizza:** The \"Veggie Lover's\u00ae Pizza\" was found at $28.55 in Redwood City. A medium Veggie Lover's Pizza could be priced around $24.34 without a deal, but was available for $10.99 with a promotion.\n\nOverall, medium pizzas at Pizza Hut are generally around $13.10, and large pizzas can cost about $15.63, with specialty pizzas reaching around $23.05.\n\n### Little Caesars\n\nLittle Caesars is often known for its budget-friendly \"Hot-N-Ready\" options, emphasizing carryout.\n*   **Cheese Pizza:** The \"ExtraMostBestest\u00ae Cheese\" large round pizza is listed at $9.31. A Thin Crust Cheese Pizza contains 148 calories per slice. Detroit-style deep-dish, which can be topped with cheese, is priced at $11.49.\n*   **Pepperoni Pizza:** The classic large \"Hot-N-Ready\" pepperoni pizza can be found for around $6.79. The \"ExtraMostBestest\u00ae Pepperoni\" large round pizza is available for $9.31. The \"Old World Fanceroni pepperoni pizza\" is priced at $11.99. A large Thin Crust Pepperoni Pizza was offered at a promotional price of $6, with its regular price being $7.\n*   **Veggie Pizza:** A large veggie option at Little Caesars is priced at $11.99. This pizza includes green peppers, onions, mushrooms, black olives, and Italian seasoning.\n\nMost items on the Little Caesars menu are under $20.\n\n### Domino's Pizza\n\nDomino's offers various crust types and sizes, with prices frequently impacted by deals and customization.\n*   **Cheese Pizza:** Prices for a cheese pizza start at $9.99 for a small size. A large (14\") Hand Tossed, Crunchy Thin Crust, or Brooklyn Style cheese pizza is listed at $9.99, while a medium (12\") Handmade Pan cheese pizza is $7.99.\n*   **Pepperoni Pizza:** The \"Ultimate Pepperoni Pizza\" starts at $15.06 for a small size or $15.99 for a medium (12\"). In some locations, specialty pizzas like the Ultimate Pepperoni were seen for $22.89. A large Brooklyn style pizza with pepperoni and Italian sausage was observed at $25.\n*   **Veggie Pizza:** The \"Pacific Veggie\" specialty pizza is available for $15.99 for a medium (12\"). In Los Angeles, the \"Pacific Veggie\" was priced at $22.89.\n\nDomino's also frequently offers deals, such as a $9.99 each for any crust, any toppings pizza, which was available until March 2nd (2025).\n\n**Please note:** Pizza prices are subject to change and can vary based on your specific location, current promotions, chosen crusts, and any additional toppings or customization. It is always recommended to check the local menu for the most accurate and up-to-date pricing."
